Late Afternoon: Visit Jaswant Thada, a beautiful white marble cenotaph sitting peacefully next to a small lake just below the fort.

Evening: Stroll through the bustling Clock Tower Market (Ghanta Ghar). Try the famous Rajasthani Makhaniya Lassi at Shri Mishrilal Hotel.', NULL, '09:00 AM', '05:00 PM', 0, '2026-09-24T08:51:59.902Z', '2026-09-24T08:51:59.902Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

Afternoon: Embark on a 4.5 to 5-hour drive (approx. 280 km) across the arid landscape toward Jaisalmer, the Golden City.

Evening: Arrive in Jaisalmer. Catch a peaceful sunset at Gadisar Lake, surrounded by shrines and ghats', NULL, '09:00 AM', '05:00 PM', 1, '2026-09-24T08:52:36.248Z', '2026-09-24T08:52:36.248Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

Afternoon: Drive out toward the Sam Sand Dunes. En route, stop by the eerie, abandoned "ghost village" of Kuldhara.

Evening: Check into a desert camp. Enjoy a camel safari or jeep dune bashing as the sun sets over the dunes. Conclude the night with traditional Rajasthani folk music, dancing, and a local buffet dinner', NULL, '09:00 AM', '05:00 PM', 2, '2026-09-24T08:53:14.296Z', '2026-09-24T08:53:14.296Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

All Day: This is the heaviest travel day of the trip. You will take a 7.5 to 8-hour drive (approx. 440 km) south to Rajasthan’s only hill station, Mount Abu.

Evening: Arrive in the refreshing mountain air of Mount Abu. Check into your hotel and spend a relaxed evening walking along the Mall Road or enjoying a warm meal.', NULL, '09:00 AM', '05:00 PM', 3, '2026-09-24T08:54:23.952Z', '2026-09-24T08:54:23.952Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

Afternoon: Drive up to Guru Shikhar, the highest peak in the Aravalli Range, offering sweeping views of the surrounding plains.

Evening: Return down to Nakki Lake for a boat ride. Catch the sunset from the famous Sunset Point or visit the nearby Toad Rock formation', NULL, '09:00 AM', '05:00 PM', 4, '2026-09-24T08:55:25.285Z', '2026-09-24T08:55:25.285Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

Afternoon: Check into your Udaipur hotel. Visit the grand City Palace, which overlooks Lake Pichola.

Evening: Relax with a scenic evening boat cruise on Lake Pichola, passing by the iconic Lake Palace.', NULL, '10:00 AM', '08:00 PM', 5, '2026-09-24T08:56:13.744Z', '2026-09-24T08:56:13.744Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

Afternoon: Depending on your flight or train schedule, enjoy some last-minute shopping for local handicrafts, miniature paintings, and silver jewelry before transferring to the Udaipur Airport/Railway Station for your journey home', NULL, '08:00 AM', '03:00 PM', 6, '2026-09-24T08:57:04.788Z', '2026-09-24T08:57:04.788Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

• Hotel Check-In: Welcome the clients with hot local apple cider or flower garlands. Let them unpack and acclimatize to the altitude.

• Evening: A relaxed, guided walk along the historic Mall Road and The Ridge. Have the chauffeur drop them off at the lift entrance to completely avoid walking up the steep initial incline.

• Concierge Tip: Book a window table for dinner at The Cecil Restaurant on Mall Road for a premium, colonial-era dining experience.', NULL, '09:00 AM', '05:00 PM', 0, '2026-09-29T07:31:43.302Z', '2026-09-29T07:31:43.302Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

• Afternoon: Drive out to Kufri (approx. 45 mins). Skip the chaotic main tourist park lanes and instead arrange a private, peaceful walk through the nearby pine trails or a horse ride through the cedar woods.

• Evening: Return to Shimla for a quiet evening. Arrange an optional private bonfire experience at the hotel terrace overlooking the valley lights.', NULL, '09:00 AM', '05:00 PM', 1, '2026-09-29T07:32:15.261Z', '2026-09-29T07:32:15.261Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

• Mid-Day Comfort Stops: Rather than driving straight through, schedule a lunch and stretch break overlooking the scenic Pandoh Dam or the beautiful Kullu Valley along the Beas River.

• Evening: Arrive in Manali. Check into a riverside or forest-facing luxury property. Keep the evening free for a slow-paced stroll around the hotel lawns to recover from the drive.', NULL, '09:00 AM', '05:00 PM', 2, '2026-09-29T07:32:40.440Z', '2026-09-29T07:32:40.440Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

• Afternoon: Explore the slow-paced, bohemian streets of Old Manali. Stop at a riverside cafe like Cafe 1947 for wood-fired pizzas, live music, and excellent mountain views.

• Evening: Visit the Vashisht Hot Springs for a brief cultural look, followed by a light evening walk across Manali''s Mall Road for local wooden handicrafts and saffron shopping.', NULL, '09:00 AM', '05:00 PM', 3, '2026-09-29T07:33:08.839Z', '2026-09-29T07:33:08.839Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

• Afternoon: Drive through the engineering marvel, the Atal Tunnel, into the starkly beautiful Lahaul Valley. Cross over to the scenic village of Sissu to view its massive waterfall.

• Special Note: The high-altitude route past the tunnel is subject to quick weather changes and safety regulations. Ensure a winter-experienced mountain driver handles this leg, and that all necessary Lahaul valley day-trip permits are pre-booked online by the agency', NULL, '09:00 AM', '05:00 PM', 4, '2026-09-29T07:33:36.573Z', '2026-09-29T07:33:36.573Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

• Option B (For Adventure/Snow Seekers): A dedicated excursion up to Rohtang Pass (if traveling between May and October).

• Concierge Note: Rohtang requires strict NGT permits that open online on a tight quota. This must be secured weeks in advance. The pass is closed every Tuesday for maintenance.

• Evening: Arrange a grand, private riverside candlelit dinner at the resort as a farewell gesture.', NULL, '09:00 AM', '05:00 PM', 5, '2026-09-29T08:44:35.768Z', '2026-09-29T08:44:50.312Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

• Afternoon: Drive back down to Chandigarh Airport or Railway Station (approx. 7–8 hours) for their evening departure flight or train home.

• Alternative: If the clients dislike long road journeys on departure day, the transit can be broken up with an overnight stay in Chandigarh, or you can check flight options out of Bhuntar (Kullu) Airport, which is just 1.5 hours from Manali.', NULL, '09:00 AM', '05:00 PM', 6, '2026-09-29T08:45:22.892Z', '2026-09-29T08:45:22.892Z') ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;

